Keeps frontend/dist/ in the repository.

main.go embeds this directory with `//go:embed all:frontend/dist`, and that
pattern is a compile error when nothing matches — so on a fresh clone, before
`wails build` has produced index.html and assets/, even `go test ./...` fails to
build. .gitignore excludes everything in frontend/dist/ except this file.

There are two copies on purpose, and they must stay byte-identical:

  frontend/dist/gitkeep    committed, so a fresh clone compiles before any build
  frontend/public/gitkeep  copied here by vite on every build, because vite
                           empties dist/ first and would otherwise delete it

`make clean` deletes the built output and leaves this file alone.
